      "writtenOn": "2025-02-27T14:33:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should be able to do the following to remove the `WGPUSType_DawnInjetedInvalidSType` case\n\n```\n{% set extensions \u003d record.extensions + [\u0027dawn injected invalid s type\u0027] %}\n{% for extension in extensions if extension.name.CamelCase() not in client_side_structures %}\n```",
      "revId": "2ae30aa2cd0a33061586464591a9551350dbe0b5",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
