      "writtenOn": "2025-02-27T14:33:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could also decide to just `return WireResult::FatalError` in this case because the client is bugged or compromised if it sends us an sType that we don\u0027t know of. It allows removing `DeserializeInvalidChainedStruct`. We don\u0027t need to try to recover from malformed commands.",
      "revId": "2ae30aa2cd0a33061586464591a9551350dbe0b5",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
